+# PATTERN-run-records
+
+This cluster guards a run's friction note, usage record and project record: each has one writer, `internal/friction`, shed's usage writer or `lym loom decision add`.
+
+## Project record
+
+Rule: Changing a beam project's scope once its pawl run passed Preflight: only `lym loom decision add <beam-slug>` on its project record, never a board body edit; a member reads the record from the beam's worktree, never writes it.
+
+Held by review alone; no test enforces it.
+
+## Friction capture
+
+Rule: Halting or crash-resuming a run, or refusing in webster: Go writes a note via `internal/friction`; none is archived before a reflection covers it. (test)
+
+## Run usage record
+
+Rule: Recording an agent session's tokens and cost per session under a run's `_lym/usage`: only shed's one usage writer, one file per session; a cost report reads token counts and session costs only from those files, never from a review round's usage record.
+
+Held by review alone; no test enforces it.
